                  <span class="eyebrow" style="color:rgba(255,255,255,.5)">Digital Assets</span>
                  <h2 class="dyn-title" style="color:white">Institutional-grade crypto.</h2>
                  <p class="dyn-body" style="color:rgba(255,255,255,.6)">Bitcoin has returned over 150% annualised over the last decade. Aidi gives you access to BTC, ETH, and leading altcoins with the same custody infrastructure used by institutions.</p>
                  <div class="dyn-feats">
                    <div class="dyn-feat"><div class="dyn-feat-icon" style="background:rgba(98,126,234,.2);color:#F7931A"><svg width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round"><path d="M12 22s8-4 8-10V5l-8-3-8 3v7c0 6 8 10 8 10z"/></svg></div><div class="dyn-feat-text"><div class="dyn-feat-title" style="color:white">Institutional Custody</div><div class="dyn-feat-desc" style="color:rgba(255,255,255,.5)">Multi-sig cold storage. $250M+ insurance. The same custody standard used by top hedge funds and family offices.</div></div></div>
                    <div class="dyn-feat"><div class="dyn-feat-icon" style="background:rgba(27,79,216,.2);color:#6B9FFF"><svg width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round"><polyline points="22 7 13.5 15.5 8.5 10.5 2 17"/></svg></div><div class="dyn-feat-text"><div class="dyn-feat-title" style="color:white">Portfolio risk monitoring</div><div class="dyn-feat-desc" style="color:rgba(255,255,255,.5)">Elia tracks your crypto as a % of total portfolio and alerts you when concentration exceeds your personal risk threshold.</div></div></div>
                  </div>
