          <section class="section sfaq-section">
            <div class="wrap">
              <div class="sfaq-header">
                <span class="eyebrow">FAQ</span>
                <h2 class="t-display">Here's what people are asking.</h2>
              </div>
              <div class="sfaq-list">
                <div class="sfaq-item" onclick="toggleSfaq(this)">
                  <div class="sfaq-q">
                    <span>How is my crypto secured?</span>
                    <svg class="sfaq-icon" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8" stroke-linecap="round"><path d="M6 9l6 6 6-6"/></svg>
                  </div>
                  <div class="sfaq-a"><p>All crypto assets on Aidi are custodied by BitGo — the industry standard in institutional crypto custody, carrying $250M+ in insurance coverage and multi-signature cold storage security.</p></div>
                </div>
                <div class="sfaq-item" onclick="toggleSfaq(this)">
                  <div class="sfaq-q">
                    <span>Which cryptocurrencies does Aidi support?</span>
                    <svg class="sfaq-icon" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8" stroke-linecap="round"><path d="M6 9l6 6 6-6"/></svg>
                  </div>
                  <div class="sfaq-a"><p>Aidi supports Bitcoin (BTC), Ethereum (ETH), and the leading altcoins by market cap. Elia tracks all positions and normalizes values to USD in real time.</p></div>
                </div>
                <div class="sfaq-item" onclick="toggleSfaq(this)">
                  <div class="sfaq-q">
                    <span>How does Elia manage my crypto risk exposure?</span>
                    <svg class="sfaq-icon" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8" stroke-linecap="round"><path d="M6 9l6 6 6-6"/></svg>
                  </div>
                  <div class="sfaq-a"><p>Elia continuously monitors your crypto allocation as a percentage of your total portfolio. When it exceeds your risk threshold, you'll receive an alert and a specific rebalancing recommendation.</p></div>
                </div>
                <div class="sfaq-item" onclick="toggleSfaq(this)">
                  <div class="sfaq-q">
                    <span>How are crypto taxes tracked?</span>
                    <svg class="sfaq-icon" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8" stroke-linecap="round"><path d="M6 9l6 6 6-6"/></svg>
                  </div>
                  <div class="sfaq-a"><p>Aidi tracks cost basis, holding periods, and estimated short and long-term capital gains across every crypto position — making tax reporting straightforward.</p></div>
                </div>
                <div class="sfaq-item" onclick="toggleSfaq(this)">
                  <div class="sfaq-q">
                    <span>Is Aidi a crypto exchange?</span>
                    <svg class="sfaq-icon" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8" stroke-linecap="round"><path d="M6 9l6 6 6-6"/></svg>
                  </div>
